			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2249906">
									

<p>The idea is workable, but it feels lacking at this point. Sure, we got these rats that can dismantle and put together mechanical items. But why do they do so? Given they originate from a lab, maybe we can tie that aspect in?</p>
<p>The ending is somewhat anti-climatic, what with the rats building a device that causes headaches&#8230; and then there's a blackboxed unknown SCP that was agitated because of that&#8230; It didn't really add much to any mystery etc. behind these rats and their actions.</p>
<p>I also agree that sex segregation for the rats should be part of the containment procedures.</p>

